{"label_alt_en":["Draft scheme of the Committee : procedure: Art. 2bis","procedure: Art. 2bis"],"label_alt_fr":["Avant-projet soumis par le Comité de rédaction : procedure: Art. 2bis","procedure: Art. 2bis"],"broader":[{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.procedure-of-the-court","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Procédure de la Cour","pref_en":"Procedure of the Court","is_facet":null}],"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","issues":[],"pages":[598,647],"pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme: procedure, article 2 bis","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction : procédure, article 2 bis","printed":["t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction.procedure-art-2bis"],"related":[],"label_scope_note_en":"The Committee considered article 2 bis of the procedure section of the drafting committee's scheme.","type":"concept","direct_count":48,"propagated_count":48,"breadcrumb_paths":[[{"id":"facet.committee","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Travaux du Comité","pref_en":"The Committee's own work","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction : procédure, article 2 bis","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme: procedure, article 2 bis","is_facet":null}],[{"id":"facet.nature","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Nature et établissement de la Cour","pref_en":"Nature & establishment of the Court","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction : procédure, article 2 bis","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme: procedure, article 2 bis","is_facet":null}],[{"id":"facet.procedure","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Procédure","pref_en":"Procedure","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.procedure-of-the-court","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Procédure de la Cour","pref_en":"Procedure of the Court","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction : procédure, article 2 bis","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme: procedure, article 2 bis","is_facet":null}]],"narrower":[],"printed_entries":[{"entries":[{"article_ref":{"art":"2bis","part":"procedure","range":null},"label_heading":"Avant-projet soumis par le Comité de rédaction","id":"fr.0027.30","lang":"fr","qualifier":null,"raw":"Art. 2bis — 588, 637.","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":598,"printed":588,"raw":"588","seq":false},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":647,"printed":637,"raw":"637","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":776,"sub":"procedure: Art. 2bis"},{"article_ref":{"art":"2bis","part":"procedure","range":null},"label_heading":"Draft scheme of the Committee","id":"en.0075.30","lang":"en","qualifier":null,"raw":"Art. 2bis — 588, 637.","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":598,"printed":588,"raw":"588","seq":false},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":647,"printed":637,"raw":"637","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":783,"sub":"procedure: Art. 2bis"}],"id":"t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction.procedure-art-2bis","label_en":"procedure: Art. 2bis","label_fr":"procedure: Art. 2bis","n_pages":2,"pages":[598,647],"parent":"t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction","printed_en_id":"en.0075.30","printed_fr_id":"fr.0027.30","see":[],"type":"article"}],"groups":[{"meeting":25,"section":"25","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0577.15","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":577,"printed":567,"texts":{"fr":"Dans le cas où la cause du différend consiste en un acte effectué ou sur le point de l'être, la Cour a le pouvoir d'indiquer, si elle estime que les circonstances l'exigent, quelles mesures conservatoires du droit de chacun doivent être prises à titre provisoire.","en":"If the dispute arises out of an act which has already taken place or which is imminent, the Court shall have the power to suggest, if it considers that circumstances so require, the provisional measures that should be taken to preserve the respective rights of either party.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","weight":1.0,"end":263,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4543,"start":174}]},{"seg_id":"s0578.02","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":578,"printed":568,"texts":{"fr":"En attendant son arrêt, cette suggestion de la Cour est immédiatement transmise aux parties et au Conseil.","en":"Pending the final decision, notice of the measures suggested shall forthwith be given to the parties and the Council.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","weight":1.0,"end":106,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4546,"start":24}]}]},{"meeting":28,"section":"28","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0597.13","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":597,"printed":587,"texts":{"fr":"M. FERNANDES propose la formule suivante : „Le droit d'intervention est reconnu aux Etats ayant un intérêt légitime, soit d'assister une des parties en cause, en raison d'un droit conjoint, soit d'exclure le demandeur ou le défendeur. Dans le premier cas, l'intervenant agira dans les mêmes délais…","en":"M. FERNANDES proposed the following wording : “The right of intervention is granted to States having a legitimate interest, either to assist one of the contesting parties, by reason of a joint right, or to debar the plaintiff or the defendant. In the former case, the intervening party shall conform…","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0597.13","speaker_id":"fernandes","certain":true,"name":"Raul Fernandes","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.02","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"M. HAGERUP de son côté a proposé la formule de l'article 21 du projet des trois pays Scandinaves, qui ne limite pas le droit d'être notifié et le droit d'intervention aux Membres de la Société des Nations. L'article est adopté.","en":"M. HAGERUP, for his part, proposed the wording of Article 21 of the plan of the three Scandinavian countries, according to which the right to receive notification and the right of intervention were not limited to Members of the League of Nations.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0598.02","speaker_id":"hagerup","certain":true,"name":"Francis Hagerup","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.03","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"The Article was adopted.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0598.03","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.04","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"Article 2 bis.","en":"Article 2 bis.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition","Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","weight":1.0,"end":13,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"en","line":4751,"start":0},{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.05","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"M. FERNANDES voudrait voir appuyer les mesures conservatoires par des sanctions efficaces, tout en laissant à la Cour l'appréciation des limites imposées par les circonstances à la portée de ces sanctions, selon le texte de l'amendement qu'il a présenté et qui a été distribué aux membres du Comité.…","en":"M. FERNANDES wished the provisional measures to be supported by effective penalties, though it should be left to the Court to decide the extent to which the penalties should be imposed in the particular instances, as provided in the amendment which he had submitted and which had been distributed to…","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0598.05","speaker_id":"fernandes","certain":true,"name":"Raul Fernandes","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.06","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"MM. ROOT, ADATCI, DE LAPRADELLE et LORD PHILLIMORE s'opposent à cette idée qui leur semble imprudente.","en":"MM. ROOT, ADATCI, DE LAPRADELLE and LORD PHILLIMORE were opposed to this, as they thought it would be unwise.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0598.06","speaker_id":"fernandes","certain":true,"name":"Raul Fernandes","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.07","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"Sur la proposition de M. de LAPRADELLE la rédaction suivante du second alinéa est adoptée.","en":"At M. DE LAPRADELLE's proposal, the following wording for the second Paragraph was adopted:","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0598.07","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.08","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"„En attendant l'arrêt, l'indication de ces mesures est immédiatement transmise aux parties et au Conseil\".","en":"\"Pending the final decision, notice of these measures shall forthwith be given to the parties and to the Council.\"","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0598.08","speaker_id":null,"certain":false,"name":null,"role":null},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.09","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"L'article est adopté, avec des modifications rédactionnelles.","en":"The Article was adopted with some modifications in the wording.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0598.09","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.10","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"Article 3.","en":"Article 3.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.11","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"Cet article est adopté avec des modifications de rédaction.","en":"This Article was adopted with modifications in the wording.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0598.11","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.12","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"Article 4.","en":"Article 4.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.13","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"Cet article est adopté sans discussion.","en":"This Article was adopted without discussion.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0598.13","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.14","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"Article 5.","en":"Article 5.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.15","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"Cet article est adopté avec des modifications de rédaction.","en":"This Article was adopted with modifications in the wording.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0598.15","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.16","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"Article 6.","en":"Article 6.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.17","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"Il est décidé que le premier alinéa formera seul l'article 6. Les deux autres alinéas seront insérés à un endroit à déterminer.","en":"It was decided that the first Paragraph alone should form Article 6. The other two Paragraphs would be inserted in a position to be settled later.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0598.17","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]},{"seg_id":"s0598.18","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":598,"printed":588,"texts":{"fr":"M. FERNANDES signale que le projet adopte un système différent pour les notifications qui devront être faites dans le pays où est établi le siège de la Cour, et pour celles qui devront être faites dans d'autres pays; cela lui paraît être inadmissible dans plusieurs cas.","en":"M. FERNANDES pointed out that the project adopted a different system for the service of notices in the country in which the seat of the Court was established, and in other countries; in his opinion, this was inadmissible in many cases.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0598.18","speaker_id":"fernandes","certain":true,"name":"Raul Fernandes","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[598]}]}]},{"meeting":30,"section":"30","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0647.01","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"ANNEXE No. 3."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.02","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"CHAPITRE III."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.03","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"(Texte revisé du Comité de rédaction, avec, en regard, compte-rendu des délibérations du Comité, du 20 juillet.)"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.04","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 1."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.05","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 2 bis."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.06","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.07","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 2."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.08","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.09","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"LORD PHILLIMORE attire l'attention sur l'article 23 du chapitre III et soulève la question du droit d'intervention."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.10","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Il croit que l'alinéa 4 est inutile si ce droit n'est pas admis dans une mesure plus large que cela n'a été fait dans l'article 23, qui parle seulement de traités généraux."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.11","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Le PRESIDENT et le Rapporteur font valoir que l'alinéa a deux autres buts :"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.12","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"1. notification pour autre fin qu'intervention ;"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.13","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"2. tenir lieu de stipulation concernant la publicité des procès."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.14","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"M. FERNANDES a proposé la formule suivante :"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.15","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"„Le droit d'intervention est reconnu aux Etats ayant un intérêt légitime, soit d'assister une des parties en cause, en raison d'un droit conjoint, soit pour exclure le demandeur ou le défendeur. Dans le premier cas, l'intervenant agira dans les mêmes délais accordés à la partie assistée. Dans le…"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.16","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"M. HAGERUP a proposé la formule de l'article 31 du projet des 3 pays scandinaves qui ne limite pas la notification et l'intervention aux Membres de la Société des Nations."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.17","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté (avec modifications rédactionnelles)."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.18","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"M. FERNANDES voudrait voir appuyer les mesures conservatoires par des sanctions efficaces."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.19","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"MM. ROOT, LORD PHILLIMORE, MM. ADATCI et DE LAPRADELLE s'opposent à cette idée qui leur semble imprudente."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.20","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Procédure."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.21","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La langue de la Cour est le français."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.22","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La Cour peut, à la demande des parties, autoriser l'emploi d'une autre langue devant elle."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.23","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La Cour est saisie par une requête adressée au Greffe."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.24","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La requête indique l'objet du différend et désigne les parties en cause."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.25","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Le Greffe fait immédiatement notification de la requête aux intéressés."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.26","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Il en informe également les Membres de la Société des Nations par l'entremise du Secrétaire-Général."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.27","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Dans le cas où la cause du différend consiste en un acte effectué ou sur le point de l'être, la Cour a le pouvoir d'indiquer, si elle estime que les circonstances l'exigent, quelles mesures conservatoires du droit de chacun doivent être prises à titre provisoire."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-2-bis","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.28","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"En attendant l'arrêt, cette indication de ces mesures est immédiatement transmise aux parties et au Conseil."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-